A||||3||rogergarrison||My Day at Mid Ohio Racecourse||||1||
Z||000000||rogergarrison||06-24-2001||08:07 PM||||I had my car entered in the Concours de Elegance today at the Vintage Gran Prix. I got to lead the parade laps right behind the pace car with the lites all flashing. I also took a video out the windshield all the way around. Had the 4' Ferrari logo flag out the sunroof all the way around. Too bad we didnt get to go over about 60 mph down the back straight. I wanted sooooooo bad to tromp the gas and take off on all that clear racetrack ahead of me. It was really cool to be asked to be the lead car. I gotta try posting some of the shots from the video at photopoint. I saw a couple of black Fieros, but no one around them, anyone we know ?<P>------------------<BR>    <IMG SRC="http://albums.photopoint.com/j/View?u=1234884&a=9116379&p=34556781"> ||||reg||1
Z||000001||87ECO5||06-24-2001||09:27 PM||||If one of them had prizmatique (sp?) paint, it was 2M4 Dale.||||reg||1
Z||000002||FieroJoe||06-24-2001||11:21 PM||||So how did you place roger?  Being to lead the pack anyways must have been an honor in itself.||||reg||1
Z||000003||rogergarrison||06-25-2001||12:13 AM||||If you mean black base and multi-colored metalflake, I saw it and checked it out. Pretty nice, I had my custom Valient painted with that too.<P>didnt win anything, I found out after (the friend I was with, 72 Pantera) that there was no judjing, they just picked 15 different cars when they registered. He just drove in didnt even dust it off and got in those top 15. It was worth the whole day just to get to lead everyone all around.<P>2mdale, if you happened to get a photo when I went by, let me know, ill pay you for a copy. No one with us had a camera, I just had the video camera on the dash.||||reg||1
